        <section class="home-hero home-bleed" aria-labelledby="home-search-heading">
            <div class="home-hero-inner">
                <h1 class="home-hero-title"><span class="home-hero-title-lead">Airplanes.live</span><span class="home-hero-title-sub">Live Flight Tracker: Unfiltered ADS-B and MLAT</span></h1>
                <p class="lead home-hero-tagline">See every aircraft, including the ones other sites hide.</p>

                <form id="home-search-form" class="home-search home-hero-search" role="search" method="get"
                    action="https://globe.airplanes.live/" target="_blank">
                    <label class="visually-hidden" for="home-search-input">Search airports, airlines, aircraft types,
                        callsigns, or hex codes</label>
                    <div class="home-search-field">
                        <input id="home-search-input" class="form-control home-search-input" type="search" name="callsign"
                            placeholder="Heathrow, British Airways, A320, BAW117, 4008f3" autocomplete="off"
                            autocorrect="off" autocapitalize="off" spellcheck="false" role="combobox" aria-expanded="false"
                            aria-autocomplete="list" aria-controls="home-search-listbox">
                        <ul id="home-search-listbox" class="home-search-listbox" role="listbox"
                            aria-label="Search suggestions" hidden></ul>
                    </div>
                    <button class="btn btn-info home-search-submit" type="submit">Search</button>
                </form>
                <p class="visually-hidden" id="home-search-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="home-map-band home-bleed" aria-labelledby="home-map-heading">
            <div class="home-map-inner">
                <h2 class="home-map-heading" id="home-map-heading">The live map, right now</h2>
                <p class="home-map-lead">Every aircraft we receive, unfiltered and unobfuscated. That includes the
                    military and special-interest traffic other trackers hide.</p>
                <p class="home-map-actions"><a class="btn home-btn-solid" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
                        href="https://globe.airplanes.live">Open the full live map</a></p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="home-band home-bleed" aria-labelledby="home-about-heading">
            <div class="home-band-inner">
                <h2 class="home-band-heading" id="home-about-heading">What is Airplanes.live?</h2>
                <div class="home-band-copy">
                    <p>Airplanes.live is a community-run ADS-B aggregator. Receivers built and hosted by enthusiasts
                        pick up ADS-B (Automatic Dependent Surveillance-Broadcast) and MLAT (Multilateration) signals
                        from the aircraft overhead, and the combined feed shows what is flying in your area right now.
                        Enthusiasts, researchers and journalists can use that data however they like.</p>
                    <p>Airplanes.live will never filter or obfuscate aircraft data. Every
                        <a href="/get-started/">feeder</a> gets the unfiltered MLAT results back.</p>
                    <p>Whether you're a plane spotter or simply curious about the skies above, the map shows the
                        traffic as the receivers actually heard it.</p>
                    <p>Airplanes.live is free to use: follow global air traffic, watch the military aircraft that many
                        flight radar sites filter out, and track any plane in real time on the live map.</p>
                </div>
                <p class="home-band-link"><a href="/military/">Track military aircraft &rarr;</a></p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="home-cta home-bleed" aria-labelledby="cta-heading">
            <div class="home-cta-inner">
                <h2 id="cta-heading">Ready to see the whole sky?</h2>
                <p>Open the map, add a receiver to the network, or come talk aircraft with the community.</p>
                <div class="home-cta-actions">
                    <a class="btn home-btn-solid" href="/get-started/">Start Feeding</a>
                    <a class="btn home-btn-outline" href="/hardware/">Get the Hardware</a>
                    <a class="btn home-btn-outline" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
                        href="https://discord.gg/adsb">Join the Discord</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

